<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Life Protection</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 14), Healer (guild level 17)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast life protection &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast life protection</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>You gesture warding signs in front of the target and protect their life force 
against energy drain. The next time someone tries to drain their energy, the 
drain is stopped, and the protection is used up.
</p><p>It lasts a long time, from about ten minutes to more than an hour, longer the 
better your protection sphere. It doesn't help against other spells. You must 
be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Energy Drain</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>